                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
                            "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["users", "me"]
                        },
                        "description": "Updates the authenticated user's profile information.\n\n**Endpoint:** `PUT /api/v1/users/me`\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `name` | string | The updated full name of the user |\n| `email` | string | The updated email address, must be unique |\n| `password` | string | The new password (optional) |\n| `password_confirmation` | string | Must match the `password` field (required if password is provided) |\n\n### On Success\n\nReturns `200 OK` with the updated user data.\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Test Updated\",\n  \"email\": \"demo@test.com\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-11T11:50:57.000000Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-03-11T12:30:00.000000Z\"\n}\n\n ```"
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "Delete User",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "DELETE",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
                            "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["users", "me"]
                        },
                        "description": "Deletes the authenticated user's account and all associated data.\n\n**Endpoint:** `DELETE /api/v1/users/me`\n\n### On Success\n\nReturns `200 OK`.\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"message\": \"User deleted successfully\"\n}\n\n ```"
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ],
            "description": "Endpoints for managing the authenticated user's own account.\n\n##### All endpoints in this section **require a valid Bearer token** in the `Authorization` header.\n\nA user can view, update and delete their own account. Admin users have additional access to manage other users' accounts via the `/users` endpoints."
        },
