                        "description": "Create a new folde by submitting the required details.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/folders`\n\n### Request Body\n\n| **Field** | **Type** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `name` | string | The name of the folder |\n| `parent_id` | int | Only if the folder is a subfolder |\n\n### On Success\n\nReturns `201 Created` with the folder data.\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"name\": \"Design\",\n    \"parent_id\": null,\n    \"id\": 1\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Subfolder\n\nReturns `201 Created` with the folder data.\n\n``` json\n{\n    \"name\": \"Fonts\",\n    \"parent_id\": 10,\n    \"id\": 2\n}\n\n ```"
