                            "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                            "path": ["folders"]
                        },
                        "description": "Returns all the folders user's created. Each folder cotains information of subfolders and resources.\n\n**Endpoint:** `GET /api/v1/folders`\n\n### On Success\n\nReturns `200 OK` with the folder data.\n\n``` json\n[\n    {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"parent_id\": null,\n        \"name\": \"Design\",\n        \"total_resources_count\": 0,\n        \"folders\": [\n            {\n                \"id\": 2,\n                \"parent_id\": 1,\n                \"name\": \"Fonts\",\n                \"resources\": []\n            }\n        ],\n        \"resources\": []\n    }\n]\n\n ```\n\n### Empty folders\n\nReturns `200 OK` with an empty response.\n\n``` json\n[]\n\n ```"
                    },
                    "response": []
